  m_text: '<size=1.3em><b>Region 2: Simplifying Radicals</b></size>


    <align=center>According
    to the letter we have received, the only way to open RShells is to <b>Simplify
    the Radical given by Mr. Geartherre.</b></align>


    <b>Here are additional
    notes written inside the case.</b>











    <i><size=0.8em><align=center>Tap
    the Screen for the Next Page</align></size></i>'
